{0E}"Hmph! We've got that stuff coming out of our ears!
As for where it is... er...{0F}
Guard! Go fetch it for 'em!!"{w}

"Well? Found the Three Phantom Stones yet?
Put your backs into the adventuring, and put your backs into finding 'em, eh?
Nwahahahaha!!"{w}

{0E}"Yeah, it's a blue thing, kinda like this,
it's all Menon-y, and the Menon's...{0F}
